@reviewApi = http://127.0.0.1:5077

### C01: complete referral (expect no_gaps_found)
POST {{reviewApi}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profile": "cardiology",
  "referralType": "specialist_consultation",
  "draft": "Could cardiology advise on further evaluation of exertional symptoms?\nCurrent medication: amlodipine.\nECG today: sinus rhythm.",
  "supportingSources": []
}

### C05: medication list unavailable (expect review_suggested)
POST {{reviewApi}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profile": "cardiology",
  "referralType": "specialist_consultation",
  "draft": "Could cardiology advise on further evaluation of exertional symptoms?\nCurrent medication list unavailable.\nECG today: sinus rhythm.",
  "supportingSources": []
}

### O07: imaging belongs to a different person (expect imaging missing)
POST {{reviewApi}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profile": "orthopedics",
  "referralType": "specialist_consultation",
  "draft": "Could orthopedics assess treatment options for persistent right knee pain?\nThe patient cannot climb stairs without stopping.\nThe patient's sibling had an X-ray showing degenerative changes.",
  "supportingSources": []
}
